        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The baobhan sith sways rhythmically and Strides up to their Speed. Each enemy creature within 30 feet of the baobhan sith at the end of their movement must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save. No matter the result of the save, the creature is then immune to Captivating Dance until they die.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until it ends a turn adjacent to the Baobhan Sith, or the Baobhan Sith dies.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} while it is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}.</p>"
        },
